#. y1:english="Hey, {PA:10}excuse me. You have a minute?\nWhat?\nWhere are you going?\n......\nDo you have an ID on you?\nUmm,||I can't let you go if you don't have one.\nIf you don't show it,\nyou're interfering with police duties,||which means I can arrest you for it.{PA:20}\nThat okay with you, {PA:10}huh?\nI don't think I have to show it.\nIf you aren't up to anything illegal,||that would be no problem, right?\nWell, it's my job.{PA:20}||And you look suspicious as hell.\n......\nBut if you cooperate, {PA:10}I'll let you go.\nHuh?\nHow much money do you have on you?\n(Is he asking for a bribe...?)\nPay him?\nWise decision.\nI won't ask you much.{PA:20}||How about 200,000 yen?\n200,000?!\nNot so loud.{PA:20}||Hehehe...\nWhat?{PA:10}\nAlright, {PA:10}you're under arrest||for interfering with official duties.\nI can send Yakuza like you to||prison anytime!{PA:10}\nDon't disrespect the police. {PA:10}Got it?!\n"
