#. y1:english="What's the matter?\nHuh?{PA:10} Umm...\nI've been looking forward to going to the||strip club,➿but I forgot my damn glasses.\nDammit...{PA:20}||I left the office early too...\nGive him something?\n\nYou give this to me...?{PA:20}\nBut,{PA:10} I can't accept this from someone||I don't know so well...\nUmm...{PA:10} it means a lot to me that||you offered.{PA:20}➿Thanks anyway.\n(I have nothing to give him...)\nIt puts me in a bind...{PA:20}||Are there glasses by chance?\nHuh?{PA:10} Are you giving me these glasses?{MS:0}||.........!\nOh my!{PA:20} I can see perfectly fine with them!{PA:20}\nWow!{PA:10} I could even see the pores||sharply with these!\nThank you!||Thank you very much!\nIt's not much,{PA:10} but take this as a token||of my appreciation.\nYou got the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Super Strong Adhesive Tape{CR:00}\".\nAdhesive tape?{PA:10} I don't think it is||of some use...\nAs a matter of fact,{PA:10}||I'm a salesperson of stationery products.\nThis adhesive tape is not an ordinary tape.\nIt's a next-generation adhesive tape||we developed betting our company.\nIts adhesive power and durability are||incomparable.\nUnfortunately, I have nothing to give you||other than this...\n......\nYou gained 500 exp.\n"
